{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/common/people.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:27:15.662721Z","id":"347ae1a9c1cb357187a6f2ff93237a9ab750d04cb23bb8835f76715d4ae7b71b","body":{"detail":"The seed writes file_authors_json as {\"<file>\": [\"<public ID>\" | null]} and artifacts.person, versions.person, assets.person by SQL. Documents have no author rows until doc_authors exists (spec §8.2), so the document path and field canaries count as the owner's: the owner's-agent sweep in tests/api_canary.rs would flag them as leaks even with a correct filter.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":325},"end":{"line":332},"content_hash":"69c1794783395cd52500496f0658b63baa7fc98082831b410280eb48aa06467a"},"suggested_fix":"When the visibility core defines file_authors_json and doc_authors, write them here in that shape, through the store where it can.","summary":"World writes versions.file_authors_json in a shape no code reads yet, and documents carry no author","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/common/clients.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T01:27:15.662857Z","id":"2623ebd6e90f8eb0fb130206db55bda769fe415b8966cedef7b1d5539c995bb5","body":{"detail":"RealClients::pi runs tests/fixtures/pi-agent.mjs with `node --import jiti/register` from plugins/pi, the loader Pi itself uses for extensions (Node's own type stripping rejects clax.ts's parameter properties). every_real_client_runs_against_the_test_daemon fails where node or plugins/pi/node_modules is missing.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":339},"end":{"line":350},"content_hash":"f8a930792a1315cf4d2bde8f2a7fac1e6056a3ca1ec2de204dd5e2f1e679260d"},"suggested_fix":"Skip the Pi channel with a message when node_modules is absent, or make sure plugins/pi's node_modules is installed before the Rust tests run.","summary":"The real-client tests need node and plugins/pi/node_modules (jiti)","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/common/clients.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T02:37:42.970588Z","id":"42fc5106a9576c364c81b38911b957033e5c9a933314ce7741647c87aefd2356","body":{"detail":"RealClients::pi runs tests/fixtures/pi-agent.mjs with `node --import jiti/register` from plugins/pi, the loader Pi itself uses for extensions (Node's own type stripping rejects clax.ts's parameter properties). every_real_client_runs_against_the_test_daemon fails where node or plugins/pi/node_modules is missing.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":405},"end":{"line":416},"content_hash":"f8a930792a1315cf4d2bde8f2a7fac1e6056a3ca1ec2de204dd5e2f1e679260d"},"suggested_fix":"Skip the Pi channel with a message when node_modules is absent, or make sure plugins/pi's node_modules is installed before the Rust tests run.","summary":"The real-client tests need node and plugins/pi/node_modules (jiti)","supersedes":"2623ebd6e90f8eb0fb130206db55bda769fe415b8966cedef7b1d5539c995bb5","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/common/clients.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:52:10.620703Z","id":"cd1a10f46c34fcfd9a1097b003387f3c026455fb2d84ef0c32810b45ac474758","body":{"detail":"RealClients::pi runs tests/fixtures/pi-agent.mjs with `node --import jiti/register` from plugins/pi, the loader Pi itself uses for extensions (Node's own type stripping rejects clax.ts's parameter properties). every_real_client_runs_against_the_test_daemon fails where node or plugins/pi/node_modules is missing.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":405},"end":{"line":416},"content_hash":"acd7116b1645a7264da9fe44686a20aba202bdddb57d46a134ad2600cfd21f11"},"suggested_fix":"Skip the Pi channel with a message when node_modules is absent, or make sure plugins/pi's node_modules is installed before the Rust tests run.","summary":"The real-client tests need node and plugins/pi/node_modules (jiti)","supersedes":"42fc5106a9576c364c81b38911b957033e5c9a933314ce7741647c87aefd2356","tags":["session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/tests/common/people.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-10T15:50:55.794904Z","id":"8ffafdb641f7f5010f54f3d26177fad6dcb274d7d8e84255b71c4fc9f46cfd78","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:5c1fbd7","summary":"Fixed: versions.file_authors_json is now read in the World's shape ({file: [public ID | null]}, null and *owner the owner; Version.authors in crates/clax-core/src/model.rs) and written at publish in it, and the World seeds doc_authors for Mia's document (doc_authors from migration 25). Evidence: cargo nextest run --workspace at e14b88e, 1893 passed, including api_canary::the_owner_by_hand_sees_every_canary (seeds and reads the World) and visibility::tests::carrying_a_file_forward_keeps_its_author.","supersedes":"347ae1a9c1cb357187a6f2ff93237a9ab750d04cb23bb8835f76715d4ae7b71b","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:4661063b-b304-434f-95f6-59a30e211068"]}}
